title: Office
---
Mr. Penelope: Hello, how can I help you on this beautiful day?
-> I'm here to apply for a job.
	Mr. Penelope: A job you say, huh?
	Mr. Penelope: Well, I'm not sure if we have any positions open, I'm afraid.
	-> I can offer you tarot readings.
		Mr. Penelope: Interesting.
		Mr. Penelope: Not something you would expect at a zoo.
		Mr. Penelope: Hmm, we are always open to new activities.
		Mr. Penelope: Why don't you do a reading for Rini?
		Mr. Penelope: She's inside, behind this door.
		Mr. Penelope: If she likes it, we can discuss it further!
		-> Thank you, sir.
-> I know your secret.
	Mr. Penelope: My secret? I'm not sure I understand.
	-> I saw someone transform into a bunny.
	Mr. Penelope: Ha. 
	Mr. Penelope: You found us out.
	Mr. Penelope: Huh. That makes things difficult.
	Mr. Penelope: I'm afraid I cannot let you leave with a secret like that.
	Mr. Penelope: I'm here to ensure the safety of us all, you see.
	Mr. Penelope: You are not leaving this zoo until you have gained our trust.
-> I'm here to take over your souls.
	Mr. Penelope: Okay, I'm not sure I understand.
	Mr. Penelope: Can I call someone for you?
	Mr. Penelope: Why don't you go inside for a while?
	Mr. Penelope: My colleague will comfort you and call someone for you.
===
